    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the rudeirer.wtf game collection. Best advent calender games of rudeirer.wtf and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rudeirer.wtf is a minigame collection which includes a variety of low-quality no-budget games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Most games only support German language but are self-explanatory enough to be enjoyed by (almost) anyone!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Overview of included Games</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K\u00fcchenger\u00e4te Company: A 3D first-person exploration game. You can explore 4 seamlessly connected levels to convert food items. Run away from not-so-scary kitchen-utensil-based enemies and defeat a final terrifying boss enemy. Supports Steam achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factory simulators (warning: includes factories) where you build factories in order to build more factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheap (see the section on budget below) games inspired by other games of slightly higher quality. Some games are web-based but we also have a native Windows game and plan to deliver more (see Early Access section).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rudimon, a fantastic almost-multiplayer 2D RPG web game with great gameplay and even greater story where you catch Rudimon on your journey to free the world from an evil mastermind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RUSL, a highly acclaimed (by some) web card game where you play cards and draw cards and discard cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetins goen out to Jens and Eddie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Important</strong></u>: This game is a no-budget game. Quality will match the budget amount. <br><strong>This is part of the intended experience!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the rudeirer.wtf game collection. Best advent calender games of rudeirer.wtf and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rudeirer.wtf is a minigame collection which includes a variety of low-quality no-budget games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Most games only support German language but are self-explanatory enough to be enjoyed by (almost) anyone!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Overview of included Games</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >K\u00fcchenger\u00e4te Company: A 3D first-person exploration game. You can explore 4 seamlessly connected levels to convert food items. Run away from not-so-scary kitchen-utensil-based enemies and defeat a final terrifying boss enemy. Supports Steam achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factory simulators (warning: includes factories) where you build factories in order to build more factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheap (see the section on budget below) games inspired by other games of slightly higher quality. Some games are web-based but we also have a native Windows game and plan to deliver more (see Early Access section).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rudimon, a fantastic almost-multiplayer 2D RPG web game with great gameplay and even greater story where you catch Rudimon on your journey to free the world from an evil mastermind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RUSL, a highly acclaimed (by some) web card game where you play cards and draw cards and discard cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetins goen out to Jens and Eddie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Important</strong></u>: This game is a no-budget game. Quality will match the budget amount. <br><strong>This is part of the intended experience!</strong></p>",
